<title>USA: CompUSA Inc says margin over three pct.</title>
<headline>CompUSA Inc says margin over three pct.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>CompUSA Inc said Wednesday it achieved an annual operating margin of over three percent, demonstrating the success of its &quot;diverse operating model.&quot;</p>
<p>The company reported fourth quarter earnings per share of $0.24 compared with $0.13 for the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>Net sales for the quarter increased 23 percent to $1.15 billion.  Comparable store sales were up 9.7 percent in the fourth quarter for the 102 stores open one year or more.</p>
</text>
